msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"You got some real coconuts coming here alone, kid. You're either outta your "
"damn mind, or you're the bravest little shit in town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"Please... I'll do whatever it takes to pay off Natsumi's debt. I have this "
"fishing boat down in Okinawa that'll cover the cost... Just please give me "
"some time to sell it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"Natsumi? You mean the stripper who's always blowing her cash at host clubs? "
"Heh, you'd do all that just for a piece of ass, kid? You're crazier than I "
"thought."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Please! You'll get all five million, I promise!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"Ugh, you're hurtin' my ears here, kid. How 'bout we teach him a little "
"lesson, boys?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Rikiya..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Look, Natsumi. These are the lengths he's willing to go to for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"So when you trick him like this, you aren't just playing with his emotions. "
"You're playing with his life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "I..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"Rikiya's too earnest for his own good. When he says he'll risk his life for "
"you, he means it. He would die if it meant keeping you safe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"You're both from Okinawa, and as far as he knows, you're family to his "
"closest childhood friend. That's why he chose to trust you. But instead of "
"accepting him for who he is, you betrayed that trust."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Urgh...!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "Rikiya, stop!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "Nat...sumi?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "What are you doing here? This is... too dangerous for you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "I'm... I'm so sorry, Rikiya!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "It's okay. I'm taking care of the money. You don't have to cry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"Well ain't this sweet? Now that you two're all nice and lovey-dovey, how "
"'bout we get a little boy-on-girl action on tape and we can call the whole "
"thing quits?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "You sick bastard!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"What'd you call me? You got a death wish, punk!? Well you came to the right "
"guy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"Rikiya. I'd be glad to lend a hand or two if you want to teach these thugs "
"a lesson."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "I was hoping you'd say that, Aniki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "The fuck are you two blabbing about!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid ""
"Sorry, but you just picked a fight with the wrong guy. I'm Rikiya "
"Shimabukuro, captain of the Ryudo Family!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "And once I'm through with you... you'll wish you'd never been born!"
msgstr ""

